UFI-TOOLS-U60-PRO-RE is a behavior-level replica of UFI-TOOLS-U60Pro for the
ZTE U60 Pro device family.

The project may incorporate or adapt portions of the MIT-licensed UFI-TOOLS
project by kanoqwq. Such files must retain their original copyright and MIT
license notices. New project code is AGPL-3.0-or-later unless a file says
otherwise.

The implementation replicates the behavior of the closed UFI-TOOLS-U60Pro
service with its author's permission for non-commercial study. No closed-source
executable, decompiler output, signing secret, private server credential,
Qualcomm proprietary utility, firmware image, or device backup is part of this
repository.

